<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET - S.AFRICA VS INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - S.AFRICA VS INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the one-day triangular series final between India and South Africa at Kingsmead on Wednesday.</p>
<p>India</p>
<p>    S.Ganguly run out					18</p>
<p>    S.Tendulkar c Rhodes b Klusener		    32</p>
