<p>    Total (for nine wickets in 50 overs)	    191</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-43 2-54 3-116 4-138 5-162 6-177 7-177 8-184 9-187.</p>
<p>Bowling: Donald 10-2-23-2 (1-w), Pollock 10-1-31-1 (2-w), Kallis 4-0-27-0 (1-w), Klusener 10-1-35-2, Symcox 10-0-49-0, Cronje 6-0-23-1.</p>
